// Recovery get-up viewmodel (MW3 berlin _id_72AD transposed to BO3). The player links to a node that plays
// berlin_sgt_down_recovery_vm via the camera-less cin_recovery_fp scene bundle; the node is stock BO3
// viewhands (c_zom_der_dempsey_viewhands) driven by the retargeted anim. Mechanism: scripts/zm/_recovery.gsc.
// GDT: source_data/_reapy/recovery.gdt  |  BINs: model_export/_reapy/recovery/, xanim_export/_reapy/recovery/

scriptparsetree,scripts/zm/_recovery.gsc
scriptparsetree,scripts/zm/_recovery.csc

xanim,berlin_sgt_down_recovery_vm

scriptbundle,cin_recovery_fp
